        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "trick_winner"
            },
            "key": "bonus",
            "value": {
              "calc": "trick_bonus"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "trick_winner > 0 and trick_bonus > 0"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "tell",
      "phase": "trick",
      "label": "trick 2 result",
      "to": "all",
      "text": "Trick {trick_number}: cards played [seat, power]: {[[p.seat, p.played] for p in players]}. Winner: seat {trick_winner} (0 means every card was an Escape and nobody won). Capture bonus recorded: {trick_bonus}."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "trick",
      "label": "resolve trick 3",
      "do": [
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "trick_number",
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "trick_winner",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "played",
            "value": {
              "calc": "int(you.hand[0])"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "you.played"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "deck",
            "value": {
              "calc": "deck + [p.played for p in players]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "trick_winner",
            "value": {
              "calc": "min([p.seat for p in players if p.played == mermaid_power]) if (any([p.played == mermaid_power for p in players]) and any([p.played == skull_king_power for p in players])) else (min([p.seat for p in players if p.played == max([q.played for q in players])]) if max([q.played for q in players]) > escape_power else 0)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "winner_card",
            "value": {
              "calc": "sum([p.played for p in players if p.seat == trick_winner]) if trick_winner > 0 else -1"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "trick_bonus",
            "value": {
              "calc": "(pirate_capture_bonus * count([p.played == pirate_a_power or p.played == pirate_b_power for p in players])) if winner_card == skull_king_power else (skull_king_capture_bonus if (winner_card == mermaid_power and any([p.played == skull_king_power for p in players])) else 0)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "trick_winner"
            },
            "key": "tricks_won",
            "value": {
              "calc": "tricks_won_per_trick"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "trick_winner > 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "trick_winner"
            },
            "key": "bonus",
            "value": {
              "calc": "trick_bonus"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "trick_winner > 0 and trick_bonus > 0"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "tell",
      "phase": "trick",
      "label": "trick 3 result",
      "to": "all",
      "text": "Trick {trick_number}: each player's last card is played [seat, power]: {[[p.seat, p.played] for p in players]}. Winner: seat {trick_winner} (0 means every card was an Escape and nobody won). Capture bonus recorded: {trick_bonus}."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "scoring",
      "label": "score the round",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "round_points",
            "value": {
              "calc": "(zero_bid_success_points if you.tricks_won == 0 else zero_bid_fail_points) if you.bid == 0 else ((exact_bid_points_per_trick * you.bid + you.bonus) if you.tricks_won == you.bid else (missed_bid_points_per_trick_off * abs(you.bid - you.tricks_won)))"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "score",
            "value": {
              "calc": "you.round_points"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "tell",
      "phase": "scoring",
      "label": "round results",
      "to": "all",
      "text": "Round {round} results [seat, bid, tricks won, points this round, total]: {[[p.seat, p.bid, p.tricks_won, p.round_points, p.score] for p in players]}."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "scoring",
      "label": "reset round counters",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "tricks_won",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "bonus",
            "value": 0
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "check",
      "phase": "scoring",
      "label": "after the last round",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round >= rounds"
      },
      "against": [
        "over"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "end": {
    "over": {
      "when": {
        "calc": "round >= rounds"
      },
      "rank_by": "you.score",
      "text": "Winner: {result}. Final scores [seat, score]: {[[p.seat, p.score] for p in players]}."
    }
  },
  "limits": {
    "rounds": 8,
    "rounds_max": 8,
    "actions_max": 1000,
    "deadline_s": 120
  },
  "rules": "The deck has {deck_size} cards, each with a power: number cards {number_card_min} to {number_card_max} (power equals the number), {escape_count} Escapes (power {escape_power}), {mermaid_count} Mermaid (power {mermaid_power}), Pirate A (power {pirate_a_power}), Pirate B (power {pirate_b_power}) and {skull_king_count} Skull King (power {skull_king_power}). Every player starts at {starting_score} points. The game lasts exactly {rounds} rounds. There is no talk phase.\n\nEach round:\n1. DEAL: all {deck_size} cards are shuffled and each player is dealt {hand_size} cards, privately. The remaining cards stay face down and unseen for the whole round.\n2. BID: all players at the same time secretly choose a bid from {bid_min} to {bid_max}: how many tricks they will win this round.\n3. REVEAL BIDS: all bids are announced to everyone.\n4. TRICKS: there are {tricks_per_round} tricks. In tricks 1 and 2, all players at the same time choose one card from their hand to play; in trick 3 each player's last remaining card is played for them. All played cards are revealed together and removed from hands.\n5. RESOLVE EACH TRICK: if the Mermaid and the Skull King were both played, the Mermaid's player wins the trick. Otherwise the card with the highest power wins the trick. If every card played has power {escape_power} (all Escapes), nobody wins the trick and no tricks-won count changes. The winner adds {tricks_won_per_trick} to their tricks-won count. Capture bonuses are recorded for the winner: if the Skull King won, each Pirate in the trick is worth a +{pirate_capture_bonus} bonus; if the Mermaid won and the Skull King is in the trick, a +{skull_king_capture_bonus} bonus is recorded. Otherwise no bonus is recorded. The winner is announced.\n6. SCORING, for each player:\n- Bid 0 and won 0 tricks: +{zero_bid_success_points}.\n- Bid 0 and won 1 or more tricks: {zero_bid_fail_points}.\n- Bid k of 1 or more and won exactly k tricks: {exact_bid_points_per_trick} times k, plus all capture bonuses that player recorded this round.\n- Bid k of 1 or more and won a different number: {missed_bid_points_per_trick_off} times the absolute difference between bid and tricks won. No bonuses.\nCapture bonuses are paid only on an exact bid; recorded bonuses are lost on a missed bid.\n7. ANNOUNCE: each player's tricks won, points this round and running total are announced. Tricks won and bonuses reset to 0.\n\nYour own hand is private. Bids, every played card, trick winners and scores are public. After round {rounds} the player with the highest total score wins; players tied for the highest total share the result (a draw)."
}
